# Bash-only commands

- Provide commands for bash (Git Bash/WSL/Linux).
- Do not give PowerShell commands.
- If a Windows path is needed, still present commands in bash form.
- When suggesting environment variables, show bash syntax (export VAR=...).
- For long procedures, include a copy-paste runnable bash snippet.
